{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become an investigator and uncover the hidden truths shrouded in darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist responds to a report of a discovered corpse and heads to the scene. As the investigation progresses, they get closer to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find passwords and hidden clues, proceed with the investigation, and survive to make it through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>With flat 2D graphics and a visual novel-style progression, there are no challenging controls.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/\uc2a4\ud06c\ub9b0\uc0f7_26-03-2025_13.45.09.png?t=1743379291\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Dark Story: Starving Child, players do not move or jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game progresses by clicking on objects on the screen or reading the protagonist's dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wow! You won't have to worry about experiencing any 3D motion sickness at all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620360?t=1743379291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620360?t=1743379291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/40f39a4474ffdd5c1e6fc20b1d07d49ab27a473e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743379291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/40f39a4474ffdd5c1e6fc20b1d07d49ab27a473e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743379291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Our game contains mature content, including depictions of severed hands and flash